Official publisher acquisition completed with curl exit code 0.
HTTP 200; Content-Type application/pdf; 16957699 bytes.
Source: https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-024-08328-6.pdf
An initial metadata read while curl was still downloading raised pypdf.errors.PdfStreamError (Stream has ended unexpectedly / EOF marker not found).
No candidate was evaluated on that partial download. No PDF repair was attempted. Metadata and SHA-256 were recorded after curl completed successfully.
